                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "80ff4549-803c-38cc-b7ac-ac56dca2bbac",
                        "entry_id": "9ffd4d62-3c52-308d-846c-42098175b24a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eating companion"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15a89744-5165-48ca-aaf9-f51b9ed2cc52",
                                "sense_id": "80ff4549-803c-38cc-b7ac-ac56dca2bbac",
                                "text": "— Чего́ тако́го он не мо́жет? — вскрича́л Фёдор Па́влович, — «ника́к не мо́жет и ни за что не мо́жет»? Ва́ше преподо́бие, входи́ть мне аль нет? Принима́ете сотрапе́зника?",
                                "translation": "\"What is it he cannot?\" cried Fyodor Pavlovitch, \"that he absolutely cannot and certainly cannot? Your reverence, am I to come in or not? Will you receive me as your guest?\"",
                                "english": "\"What is it he cannot?\" cried Fyodor Pavlovitch, \"that he absolutely cannot and certainly cannot? Your reverence, am I to come in or not? Will you receive me as your guest?\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
